    "result_text": "The suite consists of the `AcceptanceTest` class, and it's green: **2 tests, 0 failures**.\n\nDone. The change follows the repo's existing derived-field pattern and keeps structural impact minimal:\n\n- **New `MembershipTier` helper** (`mapper/MembershipTier.java`) \u2014 a small, self-contained pure function alongside the existing `MembershipNumber`/`HouseholdId` helpers. No surrounding class complexity to hold.\n- **One line added to `OwnerMapper.toOwnerDto`** \u2014 a `@Mapping` expression delegating to `MembershipTier.of(...)`, mirroring the neighboring mappings.\n- **OpenAPI schema field `membershipTier`** on `OwnerDto` so the generated DTO carries it.\n\nThe logic returns `SILVER` when `namesakeCount == 0` and an email is present (non-blank), otherwise `BRONZE`, matching both new tests (`coreSilverWhenUniqueWithEmail`, `functionalityBronzeWhenNoEmail`).",
